.
.  Macro to generate "in-control" process.  Just use normal
.  random numbers
.
device 1 x11
device 2 postscript
.
thickness 0.15
tic mark label size 3
label case asis
label size 3
x3label size 4
x3label Figure 1.3 Process after variation reduced
.
let y = normal random numbers for i = 1 1 300
let loc = 38
let scale = 2
let y = loc + scale*y
.
xlimits 0 300
major xtic mark number 7
ylimits 30 45
major ytic mark number 4
.
moving average control chart y
.
device 2 close
.
system cp dppl1f.dat control.ps
.
